1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
A real scan. Can an Agent use it?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
SemaFrame is a spatial workspace for Agents.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Import the Smithsonian museum 3D scan,
converted offline.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,500
Two real viewport picks
and one known length set the scale.

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
A distinct A/B session checks a second span.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,500
The Agent reads scale and layout—
not raw asset bytes.

7
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,500
It creates an exact proxy and editable case
around the visual-only scan.

8
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,000
Publish. Block a collision. Correct the fit.
The case stays editable.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Export the case as OpenUSD USDA. Scan excluded.

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Undo, save, reopen, and keep editing.

11
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Reality for context.
Models for decisions.
